  "carried": "The manual tools/check_package_edges.py already refuses main dd89db1 (opensip-launch, D1b, has no inventory package row; O1-a's policy admits only opensip-operability). This binding adds file rows only, so it refuses v243 and v244 alike at the head. The new crates opensip-host-law, opensip-host-metered and opensip-host-priced, and the crates/host-alloc-tests workspace's opensip-host-alloc-tests, get their package rows and the opensip-host edge update in PKG-ROWS-1 (a verify_design package-successor profile, LD-Q-161-B), which also covers opensip-launch so that check_package_edges passes on main (LD-Q-161-D).",
